==Battleground==
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

